  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MisterBowie/omp-desktop/tarball/m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MisterBowie/omp-desktop/zipball/m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7",
  "body": "M7 test packages for macOS (Apple Silicon), Windows x64 and Linux x64.\n\nThese are **native test packages, not a stable release**. All three native lanes retain the M5 runtime/Plan/Goal gates and additionally require the actual installed workflow. Public validation assets bind the raw native history, screenshots and process observations to each installer digest. Packages remain unsigned and publish no auto-update feed.\n\n## Build identity\n\n| Field | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Stage tag | `m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7` |\n| Source revision | `46e7bf733367e738edb0040aa2b7004990e1f088` |\n| Product version | `0.15.3-m7.1` |\n| Controlled patch level | `62bc57b+omp-desktop.5` |\n| Sidecar fork | `https://github.com/MisterBowie/oh-my-pi` @ `36483311dfff67be7504f591974df93fc512a45a` |\n| Upstream OMP base | `62bc57be1b03ef0802a33cf7f5f530e534527531` (18.3.0) |\n| Build run | https://github.com/MisterBowie/omp-desktop/actions/runs/38717467884 |\n\nEvery package was built and verified from that one revision by the `Three-platform test packages` workflow; the same revision binds this tag, the payloads and `BUILD-RECORD.json`.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Platform | Bytes | SHA-256 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-macos-arm64.dmg` | macOS arm64 | 224628084 | `bf84e48063cbe445df6a6b090b3ef87e114ed8a6621d4cba3fa61dd9e8d5314e` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-macos-arm64.zip` | macOS arm64 | 223439950 | `83b5dbe94bc0732b6b63c804144b93a84d8e716c091d1bb12fb202729664c026` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-darwin-arm64-validation.json.gz` | macOS arm64 | 408014 | `303d4788aa706ff0f4777f38835e0d8e966139214028e272e305676f886bb865` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-darwin-arm64-maintenance.json.gz` | macOS arm64 | 1186951 | `8e33c6ad00f9eef5e3ea182041738e7018b0e574fc81c40da50227933b9cb25e` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-linux-x64.AppImage` | Linux x64 | 250508801 | `77fc4d7a8bf3329196a38b2b4a3910bd9bd9bd05e69dd255626e3abfa5d7caa8` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-linux-x64.deb` | Linux x64 | 208062120 | `6e8b1cbc75ed889257771ca14aba3a2bdb60e63ce809afd976705bf43e43ced3` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-linux-x64.rpm` | Linux x64 | 188629721 | `7bf491cfcd1b6691d0341a412e9d1550ae616f9817517e8f0b417cf3196f571f` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-linux-x64-validation.json.gz` | Linux x64 | 394224 | `01d9b54fdf4b7d7c4d08421d083d33f89973af4ba8e8730a61f2d6fb46117c86` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-linux-x64-maintenance.json.gz` | Linux x64 | 1123167 | `3303bba723ae9f720d1e2605749e6ee3c1acd623ccc9083f309bacdcdee9df25` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-windows-x64-setup.exe` | Windows x64 | 200454507 | `3c7b6a8028d064ab743a99284c0c61947534629572904c85f22c179a38c9da14` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-windows-x64-portable.exe` | Windows x64 | 200216594 | `8e47022386d85f0a3d12493e24b4684612e389356de97b7f5276cf4066586e6d` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-win32-x64-validation.json.gz` | Windows x64 | 317298 | `99128cd6edcdb9650d7f3b5c01f6bd6ee3d60e28ce83058c55684589994cf84c` |\n| `OMP-Desktop-0.15.3-m7.1-m7-test-20261015-46e7bf7-win32-x64-maintenance.json.gz` | Windows x64 | 1065319 | `d8ecfe5f778cd072a41223f01a1ccba35aa7fe5328eff506e802f596d357d634` |\n\nChecksums: `SHA256SUMS.txt` (payload only — it never lists itself). Machine-readable provenance, verification results and per-platform pass counts: `BUILD-RECORD.json`.\n\n## What was verified per platform\n\n| Platform | Packaged runtime | Tool gate | Environment isolation | Plan/Goal regression |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| macOS arm64 | omp/18.3.0, protocol v2, `get_state` ok, stopped/reaped/cleaned true/true/true | missing-gate refusal verified (`refused`) | child env not observed (host does not expose /proc; isolated launch config used, PATH/HOME not asserted) | 15 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped |\n| Linux x64 | omp/18.3.0, protocol v2, `get_state` ok, stopped/reaped/cleaned true/true/true | missing-gate refusal verified (`refused`) | child PATH/HOME asserted (child environment readable) | 15 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped |\n| Windows x64 | omp/18.3.0, protocol v2, `get_state` ok, stopped/reaped/cleaned true/true/true | missing-gate refusal verified (`refused`) | child env not observed (host does not expose /proc; isolated launch config used, PATH/HOME not asserted) | 15 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped |\n\n## M7 installed maintenance\n\nEach native lane additionally passed a real coding task with seven project assertions, concurrent isolated projects with a background relative write, forty-turn history, real HTTP disconnection and terminal-error recovery, and no replay across restart. Resource/timing observations are bounded fixture measurements, not portable benchmarks or proof of compaction.\n\nThe exact public M6 0.15.2 installer is the checksum-pinned baseline. The native old/new/old rehearsal retains one owned install path and profile/data, backs up closed trees, preserves history on upgrade, restores exact backup inventories for rollback, keeps the new project file without replaying old tools, and completes a fresh old-version turn. Public maintenance assets include raw histories, screenshots, reports and restoration inventories. This tests manual installer/backup maintenance with the pinned OMP/schema; it does not test the automatic updater or arbitrary schema downgrades.\n\nThe packaged-runtime acceptance ran the *packaged* `Resources` — copied first to a path with spaces and non-ASCII characters, under its own HOME/XDG/TMPDIR — through the production verifier, launcher, tool gate and supervisor. The isolated launch configuration is used on every platform; where the host does not expose the child environment (no `/proc`), the table records the child PATH/HOME as not observed instead of claiming they were verified. The Plan/Goal regression ran the same real suite the source tree runs, but against the packaged sidecar and the packaged gate bundle.\n\n## Signing and update policy\n\n- macOS: **unsigned and not notarized** (no Developer ID). First launch may need the quarantine removal described in the ZIP's `OMP-Desktop-macOS-opening-help.txt` / `OMP-Desktop-macOS-open.command`.\n- Windows and Linux: unsigned test builds.\n- No `latest*.yml` updater feeds and no blockmaps are attached, and this release is not marked \"latest\", so it cannot become an update source for an installed build.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Proven per native platform: installed OMP identity/notices/update cache, default isolated data directory, real sidebar/Composer approval and tool paths, denied write preservation, approved write, external project check, three-process Stop, ordered quit, unchanged closed native history with no replay, fresh post-restart turn, and zero owned survivors. The provider is a local deterministic fixture; it does not bypass the production runtime/gate/bridge/UI/persistence.\n- Limits: unsigned/unnotarized; native folder chooser and quit confirmation dialogs, OS desktop/shortcut registration, real paid providers, macOS Intel and Windows ARM64 remain unqualified. Project/provider setup uses public preload IPC, followed by real user controls. A confirmation bypass is enabled only during teardown; production ordered shutdown still executes. Linux uses the actual extracted AppImage; no system deb/rpm installation is claimed. Automatic updater delivery, arbitrary-version/schema downgrade and signing are not covered by the manual installed maintenance proof.\n- Cursor + Plan/Goal remains unsupported and refused (ADR 0306).\n\n## 中文摘要\n\n本 Release 为 M7 阶段测试包（macOS Apple Silicon、Windows x64、Linux x64），未签名、不含自动更新 feed、不设为 latest，旧 `m5-preview` 不受影响。各平台绑定同一提交，保留包内运行时与 Plan/Goal 回归。另强制真实安装应用的审批、工具、停止、隔离与恢复流程，并公开绑定安装器摘要的原始证据；系统选择/退出确认框及系统注册不在本次证明内。M7另强制编码/并发/40回合/HTTP故障恢复及固定旧版→新版→备份还原回退的真实安装演练，公开原始维护证明；不冒称自动更新或任意schema降级。逐平台结果见 `BUILD-RECORD.json` 与 `SHA256SUMS.txt`。\n"
